  "implementation": [
    "Share the existing private application WorkerFailure through shared/worker_failure; preserve bridge imports, actual AdmissionError/Diagnostic visitor, checked admit_model and original Designer fallback.",
    "Detailed errors use Box<Retained<AdmissionError>>, charging the actual retained pointee and reachable capacities once before publication. Static reasons and rejected-detail fallback use borrowed text. Box handles, envelopes, channels and GUI copies remain separate owners.",
    "Downstream rejected/common terminals, transmitter preview and both upstream preparation variants admit dynamic errors before enqueue. Existing old results/source/revision, original controller restoration and scientific cancellation/partial/error semantics remain.",
    "Upstream RunFailure projects only original public ErrorCode and the existing bounded Qt text policy; drop opaque ApiError before publication. Category survives zero-budget fallback. No scientific/native API, namespace, schema, CXX registration or QML change.",
    "Record the independently delegated next source-path registry scope without claiming its source or runtime acceptance."
  ],
